    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "JB Kelly is delighted to present 38 Stapolin Avenue to the market. This beautifully presented four-bedroom mid-terrace home is offered in turn-key condition and boasts an impressive A-rated BER, combining stylish living with exceptional energy efficiency.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall with understairs storage and a spacious guest WC. A nicely appointed living room overlooks the front of the property. The heart of this home is the impressive open plan kitchen, living and dining area, complete with a central island, creating the perfect space for everyday family living and entertaining. A separate utility room is conveniently located off the kitchen offering additional storage and a second sink.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a large light filled landing space leads to four generously sized bedrooms. The principal bedroom is located to the front of the property and benefits from an en-suite bathroom. A contemporary family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe location of this property offers an outstanding range of amenities to suit modern family living. A wide selection of crèches, primary and secondary schools are all within easy reach, while the nearby Racecourse Shopping Centre provides excellent convenience with Lidl, cafés, a pharmacy and a range of everyday services.\r\n\r\nThe area boasts an excellent choice of leisure facilities including Trackside Tennis Club, badminton, gyms and football. Residents can also enjoy the nearby open green spaces of Seagrange Park and Baldoyle Racecourse Park, all offering excellent recreational amenities.\r\n\r\nClongriffin DART Station and a frequent bus service provide easy access to the city centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and is by appointment only with JB Kelly at 01 8393400."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\n4.45 x 1.95m\r\nHigh quality laminate flooring and fitted carpet on staircase.\r\nLarge understairs storage.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n3.85 x 4.10m\r\nBright, generously sized room to the front of the property.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\n1.55 x 1.65m\r\nWC and wash hand basin. Part-tiled walls and floor.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining / Living Room\r\n5.50 x 6.20m\r\nOpen plan space overlooking the rear garden. Large kitchen with extensive range of floor and wall mounted presses and quartz countertop. Island unit with additional storage, seating area and integrated recycling bins. Integrated double oven, hob with extractor over, fridge freezer, dishwasher.\r\n\r\nFloor to ceiling window and door leading to paved patio area to rear garden.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n1.55 x 2.50m\r\nLarge utility room plumbed for washing machine, additional sink and storage units.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n3.95 x 2.65m\r\nSpacious, light filled landing area with access to the attic via drop-down ladder.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom\r\n5.50 (max) x 3.35m\r\nDouble sized bedroom to the front with range of fitted wardrobes and carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite Bathroom\r\n1.50 x 2.20m\r\nWC, wash hand basin, cubicle shower and chrome heated towel rail.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.15 x 2.05m\r\nWC, vanity unit with wash hand basin, bath with glazed screen and chrome heated towel rail.\r\nTiled walls and floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n4.35 (max) x 3.20m\r\nDouble sized bedroom to the rear with range of fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n4.35 x 2.85m\r\nDouble sized bedroom to the rear with range of fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\n2.65 x 2.65m\r\nSingle bedroom to the front. Carpet flooring."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- A-rated property\r\n- Excellent decorative condition throughout\r\n- Energy efficient air to water heat pump\r\n- High quality sanitary ware\r\n- Paved rear patio\r\n- Short walk to Clongriffin DART station\r\n- 2 Off street car parking spaces to the front\r\n- Close to 1.8km greenway between Baldoyle / Portmarnock"
      },
